 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hnTWJNcO0mAQ7kNvwEEvuf4&_nc_oc=Adq6J6nag2Ewp2e0fY53nCVw87pq-gy1XDTuaocseVx3wNhXEreujVRM008AEbwfP8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMdC8mSerpW87Kv06QAPunFDJw_U_liHyj3keij2HJEcw&oe=6AE0C0C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xd2rFTZgvUcQ7kNvwGZhiP_&_nc_oc=Adr6adAx5srC5JOPHpymumA8uKrmNVQOUchiECD8L6f4j4zJuj9e3PN8j6caYxV-QP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMwa3fQQvXiSsgDIJdbNy_9cK89akjmOzv4TQ_wMX0qaA&oe=6AE095E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZKgAIBoRBAcQ7kNvwHy0xtG&_nc_oc=AdqcqZGbBz6FRVmpYp5TA40y86u5t3gb2zWXzVGz6rswrSnZTbKzo4KlErcW-Yjo450&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPPjZkDqzvgxuv_uQrLZ_8BdkhXCL8gkxIiCmpF8XSNeg&oe=6AE09FDC"}, {"fil